{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dizzying fish fest in a seaweed-drunk town of the deep blue: <strong>Bloop</strong>. In this 6\u201310 player underwater spy game, each dive gives you a new identity to experience the thrilling tension of cooperation and betrayal. In the blink of an eye, you build trust, pick up on silent clues, and write a surprise-filled underwater story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you take on one of three distinct roles:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/54aaf2928a6d7c6061e7a0065721b6b9.avif?t=1749416993\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innocent Fish</strong>: guardians of the town\u2019s fragile peace, dive deep into the currents of suspicion\u2014interrogating their own to unmask the hidden traitors beneath the surface.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/9c013b0ae0a6397dcb570b95b0c1d395.avif?t=1749416993\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traitor Fish</strong>: Earn the innocents\u2019 trust before striking at the critical moment\u2014sabotaging systems and slipping away into the underwater darkness without a sound.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/bd1702d2cc420a68fad1051194d42bf1.avif?t=1749416993\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neutral Fish</strong>: Pledge allegiance to no one, using whispers and rumors to upend the game\u2019s flow; you wait for the perfect moment to seize power and tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By blending deception, teamwork, and fierce competition, <strong>Bloop</strong> reveals your true underwater self at the end of every round. Ready to wag your tail? Dive into the most entertaining intrigue the deep blue has to offer!<br>With upcoming updates, the in-game shop system will let you unlock <strong>customizable characters, personal homes, and unique animations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fish will reflect its own style\u2014<strong>underwater life is about to get a whole lot more personal and vibrant!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465050?t=1749416993","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465050?t=1749416993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/e28d265cdd7a7cf2671e035d864bbf43d7d05823/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749416993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/e28d265cdd7a7cf2671e035d864bbf43d7d05823/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749416993","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dizzying fish fest in a seaweed-drunk town of the deep blue: <strong>Bloop</strong>. In this 6\u201310 player underwater spy game, each dive gives you a new identity to experience the thrilling tension of cooperation and betrayal. In the blink of an eye, you build trust, pick up on silent clues, and write a surprise-filled underwater story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you take on one of three distinct roles:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465050/extras/54aaf2928a6d7c6061e7a0065721b6b9.a